<title>HONG KONG: UBS launches warrants on CITIC Pacific.</title>
<headline>UBS launches warrants on CITIC Pacific.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said it launched on Thursday 220 million American-style call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$41.7	PREMIUM	     14.39 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.60	GEARING	     6.95 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  31.OCT.97    SETTLEMENT	  31.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    LISTING DATE	05.FEB.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT	10,000	 SPOT REFERENCE    HK$41.7</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
